WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.037
(intriguing music)

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:06.040
- [Narrator] Deep in the protected

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.090
river lands of Guizhou, China,

00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:11.030
a forest ranger has forged
a special relationship

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:13.463
with some of the rarest
monkeys in the world.

00:00:17.463 --> 00:00:20.380
(foreign language)

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:11.010
Xiao is tasked with
monitoring the monkeys.

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:12.800
It has taken decades of patience

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.400
to build a mutually trusting
relationship with them.

00:01:17.709 --> 00:01:20.626
(foreign language)

00:01:37.603 --> 00:01:40.700
Over the past 20 years,
Xiao has become an expert

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.860
in the group's rituals and behavior

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:46.043
and has given scientists unique
insight into the species.

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:51.517
(foreign language)

00:02:05.842 --> 00:02:08.560
Under his care, Xiao has
seen the number of his group

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:11.513
increase, but the species
remains endangered.

00:02:12.945 --> 00:02:15.945
(foreign language)

